<title>USA: Thermo Electron names John Hatsopoulos pres.</title>
<headline>Thermo Electron names John Hatsopoulos pres.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Electron Corp said on Thursday its chief financial officer John Hatsopoulos will add the role of president, effective January 1.</p>
<p>George Hatsopoulos, the company's founder, will continue to serve as chief executive officer and chairman of the board, Thermo Electron said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
